*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0017
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-08-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 786
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0017.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CRD0017C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 APPL-DECLINED VALUE 'D'.
    *> DECISION REASON CODE
    05 REASON-CODE        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM PRIOR-BK-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    DISPLAY "REASON-CODE=" REASON-CODE
    STOP RUN.
PRIOR-BK-SCREEN.
    IF PRIOR-BANKRUPT
        *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE - LIMIT 2.5 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF YRS-SINCE-BK < 5
            SET APPL-DECLINED TO TRUE
            MOVE 'BK1' TO REASON-CODE
        ELSE
            MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
            MOVE 'BK2' TO REASON-CODE
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO REASON-CODE
    END-IF.
